# What Vercel does NOT need to build the website.
#
# The Vercel project's Root Directory is `website`, so deploys run from the REPO
# ROOT — which makes the whole monorepo the upload context, including gigabytes
# of Rust build output. Hence this file.

# Rust build artifacts — by far the largest thing here.
app/src-tauri/target/
target/

# Desktop app bits irrelevant to the website build.
app/dist/
app/src-tauri/gen/
app/screenshots/

# Local build/test output.
website/.next/
**/node_modules/
screenshots/
